# Paranal Airglow Line And Continuum Emission (PALACE) model: data and code of
# v1.0 (Noll et al. 2024)
# 
# PALACE reference intensities for molecular lines (consistent with
# corresponding lines in palace_lines.fits)
# 
# Column names:
# lam: vacuum wavelength in µm (HITRAN2020, cosby+06)
# trans: atmospheric transmission for standard conditions at Cerro Paranal
#        (noll+12), PWV = 2.5 mm, and zenith
# fH2O: fraction of H2O with respect to optical depth (based on transmission
#       spectra with PWV = 1 and 5 mm)
# I: reference intensity in R
# ID: 13 characters describing upper and lower states (HITRAN2020, cosby+06):
#     1-2: isotopologue (OH, QH, O2, OG, or OQ; G = 17O, Q = 18O)
#     3: upper electronic state (possible prime neglected)
#     4: lower electronic state
#     5: vibrational level of upper state (OH: X = 10, O2: A-F = 10-15)
#     6: vibrational level of lower state (O2: A-F = 10-15)
#     7-8: branch of band
#     9: number of upper electronic substate
#     10: number of lower electronic substate
#     11-12: rotational level of upper state
#     13: OH: parity e or f of upper state, O2: d[ipole] or q[uadrupole]
# chem: chemical species (OH or O2)
# M: molar mass in kg/mol
# Tkin: kinetic temperature in K for Doppler broadening of line
# hlay: height of emission layer in km (H: -1)
# src: 4-digit binary code for source of intensity I:
#      1: I based on X-shooter data (partly noll+23)? 1 = yes, 0 = no
#      2: I based on UVES data from noll+20? 1 = yes, 0 = no
#      3: I based on other data (cosby+06, oliva+15)? 1 = yes, 0 = no
#      4: I based on model (= 1) or direct measurement (= 0)?
# class: label of variability class
# 
# References:
# cosby+06: https://doi.org/10.1029/2006JA012023 (OH+O2, UVES)
# HITRAN2020: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jqsrt.2021.107949
# noll+12: https://doi.org/10.1051/0004-6361/201219040
# noll+20: https://doi.org/10.5194/acp-20-5269-2020 (OH, UVES)
# noll+23: https://doi.org/10.1029/2022JD038275 (OH, X-shooter)
# oliva+15: https://doi.org/10.1051/0004-6361/201526291 (OH, GIANO)
# 
       lam   trans   fH2O          I             ID  chem      M   Tkin  hlay   src  class 
